    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-0f5adfa3-9f3c-4e06-a5c4-d9c85a655c14",
      "chapter_id": "ch-48f72dbb-3891-4db7-a860-adde640a24e4",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "sha256": "1e159e7c5a5225268aab364e95e0926700e43c30781b7eaa0fcd4237e9f1f38d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-9a04e343-69cd-4ec5-b1be-09beea6af7c5",
      "chapter_id": "ch-b8b21b29-158f-4cba-b936-4cecda2f8722",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-88a1327d-6606-4e8a-b292-f33f49959b73",
      "chapter_id": "ch-99490c63-237c-4869-a709-65b049538984",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-6bd857e1-21ee-4054-8f11-d8e06f5fb262",
      "chapter_id": "ch-b1fc5119-0332-43d8-9565-7aacfe2da9fd",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-1051addc-9550-4787-872b-5a738fac9fea",
      "source_span_id": "span-e130cfd0-72f0-41ed-b07d-70d4e0fd06f1",
      "text": "只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次",
      "sha256": "b1d239266968026fc4ef7041f32af6dabaff05fb624ba424e4693ea98dc124b5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
